        {
          "text": "Lino mbaaba bami banyika, bana ba-Israyeli mbebakazunda akuvuba nyika yabo, mutala lya-Jordano kujwe, kuzwa kumulonga wa-Arinoni kusikila kucilundu ca-Herimoni, ankanda yoonse yakujwe: ",
          "type": "text",
